":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110410006:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">黑嚎氏族为何如此强大</style>？当我们的敌人被踩在脚下时，经常发出这样的哀鸣——","source_cn":"<style=highlight>黑嚎氏族为何如此强大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74308B3C5ECF5710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110410007:1":{"text":"……真是令人厌恶的强大。","source_cn":"……真是令人厌恶的强大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE77BB24322F2FA71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110410008:1":{"text":"索恩，你还年轻，不懂得……蛮血都是血肉之躯，为何有人弱小，有人强大？","source_cn":"索恩，你还年轻，不懂得……蛮血都是血肉之躯，为何有人弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E4C5167C2C258EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110410009:1":{"text":"答案很简单。强者为了追逐力量，可以抛弃一切。","source_cn":"答案很简单。强者为了追逐力量，可以抛弃一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF01C61BFCDC699B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110410010:1":{"text":"弱者则愚蠢又贪婪，他们什么都想……“保护”，想要抓在手心。","source_cn":"弱者则愚蠢又贪婪，他们什么都想……“保护”，想要抓在手心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78B315F36B759E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_titl